# App routing

- `storeAdmin/(dashboard)/[storeId]/layout.tsx` is the access gate and shell for every store admin page (`StoreAdminLayout`); the client layout hides the sidebar on `/wizard`. `wizard/layout.tsx` adds only the wizard header.
- `(routes)/` must not have a `layout.tsx`: a nested layout there caused 404s on deep paths (for example notifications/history) under Turbopack dev.
- New store admin pages: `.../[storeId]/(routes)/<feature>/page.tsx`, with no extra layout under `(routes)`.
